### Product Catalog & Inventory Module HTTP Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 3. Filter Products by Category (Dairy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=Dairy

### 4. Search Products (by query)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?q=milk

### 5. Create a New Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nandini Curd 500g",
  "category": "Dairy",
  "price": 32.00,
  "unit": "piece",
  "description": "Pure and fresh fermented milk curd",
  "sku": "SKU-DAIRY-050",
  "location": {
    "aisle": "D1",
    "shelf": "2"
  },
  "stockQuantity": 20,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5
}

### 6. Get Product by SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/SKU-DAIRY-050

### 7. Update Shelf/Aisle Location (Smart Store Navigation)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/SKU-DAIRY-050/location
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aisle": "D2",
  "shelf": "3"
}

### 8. Restock Stock (Increment)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/SKU-DAIRY-050/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "increment",
  "amount": 10
}

### 9. Billing Sale Deduction (Decrement)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/SKU-DAIRY-050/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "decrement",
  "amount": 5
}

### 10. List Low-Stock Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/low-stock

### 11. Quick Inventory Status (Billing Cart Lookup)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/status/SKU-DAIRY-050

### 12. Worker Management - List Workers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workers

### 13. Worker Management - Add Worker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Suresh Raina",
  "role": "Inventory Specialist",
  "contact": {
    "phone": "9811223344",
    "email": "suresh.raina@smartgrocery.com"
  },
  "assignedSection": {
    "aisle": "G1",
    "section": "Staples & Grains"
  }
}
